            ("fig", "two-rankings.webp", "The same four features ranked by RICE and by weighted scoring. Bulk export is first with RICE and last with weighted scoring; SSO for enterprise is last with RICE and first with weighted scoring.", "Same four features, two rankings. Lines connect each feature's position."),
            ("p", "Neither answer is wrong. RICE is telling you what helps the most people for the least work. Weighted scoring is telling you what serves this year's strategy. If the strategy really is to move upmarket, a team running RICE alone would ship bulk export first and keep postponing the feature its biggest prospects need."),
